{
  "id": "JER.27",
  "number": "27",
  "bookId": "JER",
  "reference": "Yeremia 27",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia okwebekera amakorogoto e chiombe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Zedekia omorwoti, mosinto o Yosia, achagete kogambera Abayuda, ring’ana rigacha ase ’nde inche Yeremia korwa ase Omonene",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene antebetie: “Eroiserie chingori ne rikorogoto, obibeke ase rigoti riao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toma abanto abwo bachete Yerusalemu korora Zedekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, erinde baire ebinto ebio ase omorwoti bw’Abaedomu, na oyo bw’Abamoabu, na oyo bw’Abaamoni, na oyo o Turo, na oyo o Sidoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ochike abatomwa abwo bateebie abanene babo ng’a aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Aya naro amang’ana aane morateebie abanene baino:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninche ase okobua kwane ne chinguru chiane, natongete ense, na Mwanyabaanto, ne ching’iti chionsi chire ase ense. Ninche nkoyea omonto onde bwensi nanchire koa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono narure chinse echio chionsi nachibekire ase okoboko kwa Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, omosomba one. Boigo nabekire ching’iti chionsi chi’orosana ase okoboko kwaye chimokorere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebisaku bionsi nabimokorere, naende bikorere omwana oye omomura, na omochokoro oye omomura, nabigenderere gokora boigo goika ekero engaki y’okogwa gw’ense yaye eraike; magega y’ayio ense yaye nebe ensomba ekorere ebisaku ebinge na abarwoti abanene bare ne chinguru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende onye abanto b’egesaku kende gionsi, gose ab’abarwoti, tibagokorera Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, nabanche gosoyia amagoti abo ase rikorogoto riaye, inche omonyene ning’ee egesaku ekio egesusuro, geitwe nemioro, na enchara, na oborwaire, goika ning’ee omorwoti oyio okobua asirie egesaku ekio kegima. Nabo inche Omonene natebiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, timobaisa koigwera ababani baino, gose abaringoria, gose abarogi bande bonsi, abwo bakobateebia ng’a timogochia komokorera omorwoti o Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abwo nigo bakobang’aina na bagere moirwe ase ense y’aare; inche nimbaserie morue aiga mochie gosira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende egesaku kende gionsi keranche gosoyia amagoti abo ase rikorogoto ri’omorwoti o Babiloni na komokorera, inche ningetige kebeere ase ense yaye koyerema na koyemenya.” Nab’Omonene atebiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana ayio naro natebeetie Zedekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda: “Mosoyie amagoti aino ase rikorogoto ri’omorwoti o Babiloni, momokorere ere amo nabaanto baye, nainwe namobe moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nase ki aye amo nabaanto bao moganetie gokwa ase ogoitwa nemioro na enchara, na oborwaire? Ayio nar’Omonene atebiire arakoreke ase egesaku kende gionsi keraange gokorera omorwoti o Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa koigwera amang’ana ’ababani abwo bakobateebia ng’a: Timokorera omorwoti o Babiloni. Ase ogoteeba igo, obwo noborimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nigo agoteeba iga: Inche timbatometi abwo, korende nigo bakobana amang’ana ’oborimo ase erieta riane, nayio nagere inche mbaserie morue aiga mochie gosira, inwe amo nababani abwo bakobaabaanera oborimo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ngakwana nabakuani na abanto bonsi, nkabateebia, Aya nar’Omonene atebiire: Timobaisa koigwera amang’ana ababani baino, abwo bakobaabaanera, bagoteeba: Rora, ebikorero bi’enyomba y’Omonene nabiiranigwe korwa Babiloni bwango iga. Obwo noborimo bakobaabaanera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa kobaigwera; inwe korera omorwoti o Babiloni, nario morabe moyo. Nase ki omochie oyo orasarigwe obe amaturi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye barabwo bare ababani b’ekeene, na onye ring’ana ri’Omonene rire ase bare, tiga basorore Omonene bw’Emeganda ng’a ebikorero ebio bitigarete ase enyomba y’Omonene na ase enyomba y’Omorwoti bw’Abayuda agwo Yerusalemu bitigwe tibiirwa Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda agoteeba igoro ye chisiiro, na egetuba keria ekenene, na ebibekerero binde biatigarete ase omochie oyo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebio Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, atairete ekero keria airete korwa ase Yerusalemu Yekonia mosinto o Yehoyakimu, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, amo nabanene bonsi b’Abayuda na aba Yerusalemu, akabaira Babiloni ase obosomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro Nyasae bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba igoro y’ebikorero biria biatigarete ase enyomba y’Omonene, na ase enyomba y’omorwoti bw’Abayuda na ase Yerusalemu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebinto ebio nabiirwe goika Babiloni bigenderere kobeerao, goika ekero rituko riria ndabianchere birusigweo birentwe aase aiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
